"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">by Demonchilde: </span></span>http://www.mediafire.com/download/kjdmg2vzm5j/Atlantis.rtf<br /> Expanded Allies and Yankees Pantheon <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">by Demonchilde: </span></span>http://www.mediafire.com/download/ti1zlatjgjo/AlliesandYankees.rtf<br /> The Ayllus Pantheon (Incan) by Demonchilde: <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/download/ohaj5wjgjmk/Ayllus.rtf\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.mediafire.com/download/oh...jmk/Ayllus.rtf</a><br /> The Tjukurpa Pantheon (Pan-<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Australian Aboriginal</span></span>) by Demonchilde: <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/download/zhmhyb4unyd/Tjukurpa.rtf\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.mediafire.com/download/zh...d/Tjukurpa.rtf</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Expanded Yankee Pantheon by Poetria: </span></span>http://www.4shared.com/file/123561148/bc178dc4/YankeePantheonRTF.html<br /> Alternate Yazatas Pantheon by Man in Black: <a href=\"http://www.4shared.com/file/123931082/4e970eea/Scion_-_The_Yazatas.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.4shared.com/file/12393108...e_Yazatas.html</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2099-brothersale","name":"brothersale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2099_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T12:16:09-08:00","id":58237,"title":"","content":"Some more recovered from old forums:<br /> The Muppets Pantheon by Halloweenman33: <a href=\"http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371747/Scion-The-Muppets-Pantheon\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371747/...ppets-Pantheon</a><br /> The Toon Pantheon by Halloweenman33: <a href=\"http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371746/Scion-The-Toons-Pantheon\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371746/...Toons-Pantheon</a><br /> Additional gods (New) by various creators: <a href=\"http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371739/Scion-Additional-Gods\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371739/...dditional-Gods</a><br /> <br /> The following are also from old forum and wiki and while they are interesting, alas are also incomplete and I deeply hope their creators will read them here and decide to finish them.<br /> The Storied Pantheon by Saintbroom: <a href=\"http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371743/Scion-The-Storied-Pantheon\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371743/...oried-Pantheon</a><br /> The Ghedan Pantheon by Telgar: <a href=\"http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371744/Scion-The-Ghedan-Pantheon\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371744/...hedan-Pantheon</a><br /> The Wiccan Pantheon by Speaknoevilma: <a href=\"http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371741/Scion-The-Wiccan-Pantheon\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371741/...iccan-Pantheon</a><br /> The Jainko Pantheon by Toni D.: <a href=\"http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371745/Scion-The-Jainko-Pantheon\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371745/...ainko-Pantheon</a><br /> The Jumala Pantheon by Toni D. and Dean Shomshak: <a href=\"http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371742/Scion-The-Jumala-Pantheon\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371742/...umala-Pantheon</a><br /> The Grigori Pantheon by Tashiro: <a href=\"http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371740/Scion-The-Grigori-Pantheon\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371740/...igori-Pantheon</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2099-brothersale","name":"brothersale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2099_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T13:31:11-08:00","id":58281,"title":"","content":"Added the JSR Inuit Pantheon to the main list.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T15:35:58-08:00","id":61785,"title":"","content":"Any chance of updating the quick reference with JSR's newer pantheons?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/267-griffinguy24","name":"griffinguy24","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar267_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-22T21:40:01-07:00","id":96713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brothersale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1377-fan-written-scion-material?p=58237#post58237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some more recovered from old forums:<br /> The Grigori Pantheon by Tashiro: <a href=\"http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371740/Scion-The-Grigori-Pantheon\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.scribd.com/doc/202371740/...igori-Pantheon</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for recovering it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Much appreciated!<br /> <br /> Tashiro","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1976-tashiro","name":"Tashiro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1976_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T06:39:08-07:00","id":99115,"title":"","content":"A long time ago someone made a huge list of antagonists, mostly from various pop culture sources on the old forums. Examples include Godzilla, Diablo, the Stay Puff Marshmallow Man, Aliens, Predators, and a bunch of stuff from Resident Evil. Did anybody ever manage to save those, I liked them even though they don't really fit the default setting that well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T21:37:16-07:00","id":105365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1377-fan-written-scion-material?p=99115#post99115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A long time ago someone made a huge list of antagonists, mostly from various pop culture sources on the old forums. Examples include Godzilla, Diablo, the Stay Puff Marshmallow Man, Aliens, Predators, and a bunch of stuff from Resident Evil. Did anybody ever manage to save those, I liked them even though they don't really fit the default setting that well.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've got a very crude Libre Office Document and/or PDF of it. Never did find the time to really make it work right. Should I PM it or upload it somewhere?<br /> <br /> And linkie for download of Haloween33's great character writeups.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/bayazbfmq7v0r71/Scion_Bestiery_Document_WIP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/bayazbfmq7v0r71/Scion_Bestiery_Document_WIP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/bayazbfmq7v0r71/Scion_Bestiery_Document_WIP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.mediafire.com/view/bayazbfmq7v0r71/Scion_Bestiery_Document_WIP.pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/qxip22dcs71m7xy/Scion_Bestiery_Document_(WIP).odt\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/qxip22dcs71m7xy/Scion_Bestiery_Document_(WIP).odt\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/qxip22dcs71m7xy/Scion_Bestiery_Document_(WIP).odt\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.mediafire.com/view/qxip22dcs71m7xy/Scion_Bestiery_Document_(WIP).odt </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1246,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1246-arthurhansen","user":"ArthurHansen","date":". 04-04-2014, 10:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1246-arthurhansen","name":"ArthurHansen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1246_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T13:22:15-07:00","id":132691,"title":"","content":"The link for Scion Armory isn't working anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T21:19:59-07:00","id":133155,"title":"","content":"Unfortunately, that was not one of the documents I was keeping active on MediaFire. Someone else asked me to include it. I'll just add a note that the link may be broken, in case it ever comes back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-14T05:11:22-07:00","id":168800,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/scionoverhaul/\" target=\"_blank\">2.0</a> may have it's own thread, but it should go on the list...which unfortunately now has a number dead links...rest in piece John's Scion Resources (GothamByNight), rest in piece.<br /> <br /> Edit: Actually, a lot of it saved <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/download/suueqq4g32kbxfu/JSR+CompendiumOCR.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":".  more info 06-14-2014, 10:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T04:37:22-07:00","id":171549,"title":"","content":"Here's a fairly long list of Knacks we use for our games:<br /> <a href=\"http://tideofthunder.wikia.com/wiki/Knacks_%28Scion%29\" target=\"_blank\">http://tideofthunder.wikia.com/wiki/Knacks_%28Scion%29</a><br /> <br /> and quick reference chart for a lot of purview boons:<br /> <a href=\"http://tideofthunder.wikia.com/wiki/Purviews_%28Scion%29\" target=\"_blank\">http://tideofthunder.wikia.com/wiki/...ws_%28Scion%29</a><br /> <br /> sadly, not entierly in english as it was written for a Swedish player<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/593-gemstone","name":"Gemstone","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T05:50:16-07:00","id":172689,"title":"","content":"I have removed the GbN material links. I contacted them and asked if they would let me re-host their material, but they have asked that I not do so, since they may want to use that research and material for future projects not related to Scion. They have no problem with anyone sharing the PDFs with their players or friends, but simply would prefer that it not be posted publicly. The same extends to the PDF compilation of material from their website.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":235,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","user":"Telgar","date":". 06-18-2014, 08:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T18:05:36-07:00","id":173398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Telgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1377-fan-written-scion-material?p=172689#post172689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have removed the GbN material links. I contacted them and asked if they would let me re-host their material, but they have asked that I not do so, since they may want to use that research and material for future projects not related to Scion. They have no problem with anyone sharing the PDFs with their players or friends, but simply would prefer that it not be posted publicly. The same extends to the PDF compilation of material from their website.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's unfortunate... GbN was among the best sites on the web for Scion related material. Hopefully they'll change their mind in the future.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/593-gemstone","name":"Gemstone","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T21:21:23-07:00","id":173662,"title":"","content":"Thank you very much Telgar. <br /> Gemstone, we wont be changing our mind. But I do understand the hole this has left for good online resources in the community. However, I'm sure others will pick up the slack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1051-jsr","name":"JSR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1051_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T17:35:46-07:00","id":175654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JSR</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1377-fan-written-scion-material?p=173662#post173662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you very much Telgar.<br /> Gemstone, we wont be changing our mind. But I do understand the hole this has left for good online resources in the community. However, I'm sure others will pick up the slack.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's sad to see your resources leave, but I wish you all luck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/593-gemstone","name":"Gemstone","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T06:23:39-07:00","id":177878,"title":"","content":"Her is a new link to the Armory<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/akesf3fe1kkwwjn/Scion%20-%20Armory%20v02.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/akesf3fe1kkwwjn/Scion%20-%20Armory%20v02.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/akesf3fe1kkwwjn/Scion%20-%20Armory%20v02.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.dropbox.com/s/akesf3fe1kkwwjn/Scion%20-%20Armory%20v02.pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-01T06:14:07-07:00","id":185463,"title":"","content":"Question: Does anyone have a downloadable of GBN's Scion Character Sheets?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1675-weirdboyz","name":"Weirdboyz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1675_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"212"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T03:42:26-07:00","id":193368,"title":"","content":"I know this is a complete shot in the dark since the last post made was nine days ago, but does anyone have the information on a fan-made god known as the Wanderer? I was planning on using him for a character in the near future but I've looked all over and cannot find the information that used to be on the wiki. The idea behind the god was that he showed up to large events that he was never invited too because he wanted to be involved, did the slightest things to gain revenge (there was a story about Amaterasu and him having a bit of a disagreement with the end result of the Wanderer being cast out. Then, the next day, a gust of wind knocked over her tea cup.) on people who mistreat him, and all together just a guy who hung out on the sidelines.<br /> <br /> Any help would be deeply appreciated!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3465-mrlovedinosaur","name":"MrLoveDinosaur","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-31T23:32:41-07:00","id":215593,"title":"","content":"Hey, I have a question. At one point in the fan made section, perhaps on the old white wolf forums, there was a section of fan made pantheon headquarters. One of them was a library that was accessed through different ruins and libraries like the library of congress, etc. Anyone remember where I could find that list?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Nothing is foolproof for a sufficiently talented fool.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/981-bigwhitt","name":"bigwhitt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-01T11:44:34-07:00","id":216058,"title":"","content":"I don't remember anything about Pantheon headquarters.. there was a list of Touchstones? Are you thinking of that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T19:54:07-07:00","id":257801,"title":"","content":"Does anyone have a copy of the Followers/Creatures creation rules by FrivYeti? We used them to build a couple background characters for our game and want to add a few more, but they were posted on the white wolf wiki that's been taken down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3874-darchon45","name":"darchon45","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-11T03:05:29-07:00","id":278039,"title":"","content":"Brythonic Pantheon<br /> Apologies if this is posted in the wrong place...<br /> I\u2019ve been trying to come up with a fair and useable British pantheon for \u2018modern\u2019 scion purposes. I\u2019ll post what I have so far: if anyone has any ideas for amendments or to fill in the gaps, please let me know and I\u2019ll add in your ideas.<br /> The list I have come up with incorporates deities that have been worshipped since Roman times, up to the present day. I don\u2019t want to include those deities that can be seen as aspects of existing Scion Gods/Goddesses, particularly the Dodekatheon, so derivatives of Roman Gods such as Mars are out as they tie in with Ares. So far, the Gods I have listed are based on Wiccan, Roman, Norman and to a certain extent Celtic deities. Saxon Gods are out as they are derivatives of the Aesir.<br /> I have deliberately omitted semi-mythical characters such as Boudica, King Arthur and Robin Hood as they were never worshipped as Gods and (for gaming purposes) are more likely to have been Scions themselves.<br /> So far the Pantheon look like this;<br /> <b>Ankou</b>; God of Death, the Grave Guardian.<br /> Animal (Owl), Civitas, Death, Epic Appearance, Guardian, Prophecy, Psychopomp<br /> Control, ?<br /> <b>Andraste</b>; Goddess of war and victory.<br /> Animal (Hare), Civitas, Epic Charisma, Epic Strength, Epic Stamina, War<br /> Command, Control, Fortitude, Integrity, Melee, Politics<br /> <b>Aradia</b>; the Mother Goddess, the Moon Goddess, the Triple Goddess, chief of the Pantheon.<br /> Civitas, Earth, Epic Intelligence, Epic Stamina, Epic Strength, Fertility, Guardian, Magic, Moon<br /> Academics, Art, Athletics, Craft, Fortitude, Presence<br /> <b>Britannia</b>; the Avatar of Britain, Goddess of valour, leadership, and the sea.<br /> Animal (Lion), Civitas, Epic Charisma, Epic Intelligence, Guardian, Justice, Water<br /> Academics, Awareness, Command, Integrity, Politics, Presence<br /> <b>Cernunnos</b>; the Horned God, the Green Man, Lord of the Hunt. Consort of Aradia.<br /> Animal (Stag, Dog), Civitas, Death, Epic Appearance, Epic Perception, Epic Stamina, Epic Strength, Fertility, Psychopomp, Sun<br /> Animal Ken, Athletics, Fortitude, Marksmanship, Presence, Survival<br /> <b>Sulis</b>; Goddess of health, springs, curses and blessings.<br /> Animal (Snake), Civitas, Guardian, Health, Magic, Water<br /> Medicine, ?<br /> Thoughts? Once the Pantheon is complete I'll create a pdf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4057-darkusmarkus","name":"DarkusMarkus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-14T12:15:33-07:00","id":281363,"title":"","content":"Recently been going over my older fan resources, found out about Gothambynight going down. Would it be possible to get a copy of the Reliquary PDF? I'm afraid my shorthand notes aren't going to cut it for the next series with my RL group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4089-b-b-rain","name":"B.B. Rain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T11:23:45-07:00","id":289775,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure if you noticed, but all resources credited to one &quot;Biblioteque Interdite&quot; are down. <br /> <br /> Also, found two new versions of a Dream purview, though I'm not mechanically adept enough to know for sure. <br /> First:<br /> <a href=\"https://sciontbm.obsidianportal.com/wikis/dream#d11\" target=\"_blank\">https://sciontbm.obsidianportal.com/wikis/dream#d11</a><br /> Second:<br /> <a href=\"http://cycleofthegodless.forumotion.com/t79-dream-purview\" target=\"_blank\">http://cycleofthegodless.forumotion....-dream-purview</a><br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, does anyone have a copy of Dean Shomshak's Jumala Pantheon or Telgar's Ghedan Pantheon that ISN'T on Scribd? I was just hoping to look at a copy without having to download some suspicious app.<br /> EDIT2: never mind, it turns out I can acess them on my laptop, but not my phone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3514,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","user":"ZealousChristian24","date":".  Found something 10-24-2014, 12:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T05:15:13-07:00","id":509803,"title":"","content":"Hello everyone.<br /> <br /> I've loved having access to this list. It has proved invaluable for tinkering with my own Scion game. As an unrepentant tinkerer, thank you. In the interest of giving back to the community, I'd like to share some of my own edits.<br /> <br /> <b>1) <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/piycpodts7773e2/Animal%20Purview.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Another Animal APP</a></b><br /> I owe an incalculable debt to Iry for allowing me access to his custom Animal purview. His work is excellent. I just didn't want to lose the idea of a God being associated with a specific animal, and I wanted my characters to be able to turn into Nemean and Typhonian versions of their chosen animal. But I also liked Iry's hunter focused boons and didn't want to lose those.<br /> I've taken his boons and defined the boons as being either Specific or General. Specific ones work for only the chosen animal, General boons work for all. I also shifted some of the boons around a little in terms of power level. Nemean Form and Typhonian Form powers have been added.<br /> Thank you Iry.<br /> <br /> <b>2) <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/d02ourgjz0ujngh/Illusion%20Purview%202.0.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Amalgamated the &quot;Quick &amp; Dirty&quot; Illusion rules from Demigod with the Illusion purview</a></b><b><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/d02ourgjz0ujngh/Illusion%20Purview%202.0.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> in Ragnarok</a></b><br /> I wanted a more flexible Illusion purview. What power better fits the idea of only being limited by your imagination imagination?<br /> Yes, it's a little complicated. I just get my players to describe what Illusion they want to cast and do the math myself. If they're not specific enough about something... well that's part of the fun. Law of unintended consequences and all that.<br /> If you're looking through it and wondering &quot;what was he thinking?!&quot; there's a file <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/zswlpoi1eslysjb/Illusion%20Purview%202.0%20notes.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> with my edits telegraphed and explained.<br /> <br /> <b>3) <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/7y36dd5frcf8193/Crafting%20boons.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">A balancing of the &quot;craft element&quot; boons</a></b><br /> They've been brought in line with each other. Their magnitude now scales with Legend and activation roll. More details in the document.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5832-seamus_quigley","name":"seamus_quigley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-28T05:35:38-07:00","id":642870,"title":"","content":"Would someone have the Mayan,Slavs,Inuit JSR's pantheons to send by mail or PM. They were awesome and I did not think to snatch them before the site went down.<br /> <br /> Thanks by advance<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2225-ganonso","name":"ganonso","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2225_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-21T09:16:16-07:00","id":673247,"title":"","content":"Hello to all, this is my first post in this forum, please don't slap me, when I do anything wrong - better tell me, what is wrong. Thanks!<br /> <br /> Is there a way, to get the stuff on scribd without an account there?<br /> What is included in the stuff of Gotham by Night, sound's interesting!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8014,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8014-little_digit","user":"Little_Digit","date":". 09-21-2015, 03:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8014-little_digit","name":"Little_Digit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-01T17:12:45-07:00","id":685062,"title":"","content":"Ganonso, I think I have most of those. Not sure if Inuit one is correct as I have it filed under Other instead of JSR.<br /> <br /> PMd to find out which you still need.<br /> <br /> Does anyone happen to have the Silwannes Hittite one they put out like right at before turning off the site? I somehow missed it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7749-ibnshisha","name":"IbnShisha","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-02T23:50:14-07:00","id":686624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IbnShisha</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1377-fan-written-scion-material?p=685062#post685062\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone happen to have the Silwannes Hittite one they put out like right at before turning off the site? I somehow missed it.</div> </div> </div> </div>PM me and I'll send it over.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T11:34:29-08:00","id":828322,"title":"","content":"I managed to find a collection of Birthrights that supposedly came from a thread on the old forum, though the link doesn't work and it doesn't appear to say who compiled it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/17zkP_jt0fGgpBcmYgFTVR2cC1gEkO_S0qZiaYFm40Po/mo